# Test your FastAPI endpoints

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/hello/User
Accept: application/json

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

# 添加一篇 arXiv 论文：下载 PDF -> 切分 -> 向量化 -> 存入 Milvus
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/papers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.00597"
}

###

# 论文问答：agent 自己决定要不要查库、查几次，返回问题、答案和来源
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/query/paper
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "这篇论文提出的方法在哪些数据集上做了实验？",
  "top_k": 3
}

###

# 追问：带上上一轮返回的 conversation_id，历史由服务端提供
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/query/paper
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "那它的实验结果呢？",
  "conversation_id": "把上一轮返回的 id 填这里"
}

###

# 流式问答（SSE）：返回 status / sources / token / done 事件
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/query/paper/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "48Ca 那篇论文的熵是怎么定义的？"
}

###

# 会话列表 / 详情
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/conversations
Accept: application/json

###

# 上传本地 PDF：只落盘，返回 paper_id（同步，很快）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/papers/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="my-paper.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./data/papers/uploads/58975818caec48eaa4e48384b238ca07.pdf
------boundary--

###

# 提交后台解析入库，立刻返回；进度用下面那个接口查
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/papers/upload/upload:把paper_id填这里/parse

###

# 论文列表（元数据表，含标题、来源、状态、页数、块数）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/papers
Accept: application/json

###

# 单篇详情：status = indexing 表示后台还在跑，failed 看 error
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/papers/arxiv:2601.00597
Accept: application/json

###

# 删除论文（向量 + 元数据 + 磁盘文件一起清）
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/papers/arxiv:2601.00597

###
